---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import artistsImage from '@/assets/about-artists.jpg';
import bioImage from '@/assets/about-bio.jpg';
import gearImage from '@/assets/about-gear.jpg';
import nameImage from '@/assets/about-name.jpg';
import Question from '@/components/Question.astro';
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="grid grid-cols-1 border-t border-default md:grid-cols-[4rem_1fr_4rem]"
>
  {/* Left gutter */}
  <div
    class="hidden h-full items-center border-r border-default pt-12 pb-6 writing-vertical md:flex"
  >
    <h2 class="sticky top-22 text-subtle">ABOUT</h2>
  </div>
  {/* Center content */}
  <div class="">
    <h2 class="bg-subtle px-6 py-2 text-subtle md:hidden">ABOUT</h2>
    <Question question="A quick intro">
      <p>
        Hi! I'm <span class="text-accent">xfoxx</span>, a student, tech nerd,
        and bedroom producer.
      </p>
      <p>
        My music varies a bit in mood and style, but stays mostly within the EDM
        umbrella. I like simple, catchy melodies and pronounced drum beats, but
        I also enjoy veering into more wonky sound design.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've been making music for fun since I was a kid, uploading songs to
        SoundCloud. In 2025, I decided to start releasing my music on streaming
        platforms, mainly to make it easier for my friends to listen to it. I
        hope you like it too!
      </p>
      <Image
        src={bioImage}
        alt="Compact MIDI keyboard, headphones, and a laptop"
        slot="image"
      />
    </Question>
    <Question question="Artists that inspire me">
      <p>
        I love many kinds of music and don't really have a favourite artist, but
        here are some of my most influential ones:
      </p>
      <ul
        class="grid list-disc grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 pl-8 lg:list-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:pl-0"
      >
        <li>Avicii</li>
        <li>Bou</li>
        <li>Camo & Krooked</li>
        <li>Chase & Status</li>
        <li>C418</li>
        <li>Elephante</li>
        <li>Etherwood</li>
        <li>Fox Stevenson</li>
        <li>Flume</li>
        <li>Fred again..</li>
        <li>goddard.</li>
        <li>Gryffin</li>
        <li>Hybrid Minds</li>
        <li>ILLENIUM</li>
        <li>Knock2</li>
        <li>Lena Raine</li>
        <li>Mild Minds</li>
        <li>Phibes</li>
        <li>piri</li>
        <li>San Holo</li>
        <li>Skrillex</li>
        <li>The Chainsmokers</li>
        <li>venbee</li>
        <li>Vibe Chemistry</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-subtle italic">...and many more!</p>
      <Image
        src={artistsImage}
        alt="List of artists in my Spotify library"
        slot="image"
      />
    </Question>
    <Question question="Gear and software">
      <p>
        I use <span class="text-accent">Ableton Live</span> on my <span
          class="text-accent">MacBook Air (M2, 2022)</span
        >. Apart from the stock plugins, my favourites include
      </p>
      <ul
        class="grid list-disc grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 pl-8 lg:list-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:pl-0"
      >
        <li>Komplete 15</li>
        <li>V Collection 9</li>
        <li>FX Collection 4</li>
        <li>ShaperBox 3</li>
        <li>Vital</li>
        <li>Kilohearts Essentials</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        My main controllers are the
        <span class="text-accent">Arturia MiniLab 3</span>
        and <span class="text-accent">Ableton Push 2</span>. For audio, I use a
        <span class="text-accent">Focusrite Scarlett 2i2</span>,
        <span class="text-accent">Beyerdynamic DT 700 PRO X</span>, and <span
          class="text-accent">Shure SM57</span
        >. My samples come from <span class="text-accent">Splice</span> and I release
        through <span class="text-accent">LANDR</span>.
      </p>
      <Image
        src={gearImage}
        alt="MIDI keyboard, microphone, and laptop"
        slot="image"
      />
    </Question>
    <Question question="Behind the name">
      <p>
        <span class="text-accent">xfoxx [eks-foks]</span> is a screen name I've used
        since I was a kid. I created it on my Nintendo DS Lite around 2010 with roughly
        the following thought process:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-8">
        <li>Fox is a cool animal</li>
        <li>X is a cool letter</li>
        <li>37 (?)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <span class="text-accent">X-fox 37</span> it was. Luckily, I've cleaned up
        the spelling since then.
      </p>
      <p>
        Sometimes I think about changing my name, but it's been with me for so
        long at this point. And I do like it—a bit gamery but still rather neat.
      </p>
      <Image
        src={nameImage}
        alt="The username settings screen on a Nintendo DS Lite"
        slot="image"
      />
    </Question>
  </div>
  {/* Right gutter */}
  <div class="hidden h-full border-l border-default md:block"></div>
</section>
